  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Providing technical assistance to Madagascar&#x2019;s carbon policy reform.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The decision to fund technical assistance to the Ministry of Environment and Sustainable Development (MEDD) in Madagascar was informed by the report by the global law firm DLA Piper in May 2024 which set out several recommendations to improve Madagascar&#x2019;s carbon regulatory framework by facilitating participation of the private sector and extending the scope of the mechanism to include reforestation schemes.</narrative>
  </description>
